From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: port required SM8550 hardware descriptions

Porting notes: apply the shared CPU cache topology correction and CCI1 master 1 to 7.3-rc5. The board uses CCI1 master 1. Deliberately omit the GPU_CC four-domain change because it conflicts with the 7.3 binding, plus unrelated QoS, extra CDSP banks, GPU IFPC, high-refresh OPPs, and the PCIe IOMMU mapping revert.

Original author dates, messages, and trailers: patches/ORIGINS.md.
Source-Commit: https://github.com/ianchb/sm8550-mainline/commit/bf804e88550305bc475f1623b8dfc93218d9b103
Source-Commit: https://github.com/ianchb/sm8550-mainline/commit/e4f0e6ae7a27c2174f615f16574d201e200f267b
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi
index 0e701e7..c4ff56e 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi
@@ -73,6 +73,12 @@ cpu0: cpu@0 {
 			reg = <0 0>;
 			clocks = <&cpufreq_hw 0>;
 			enable-method = "psci";
+			d-cache-size = <0x8000>;
+			d-cache-line-size = <64>;
+			d-cache-sets = <128>;
+			i-cache-size = <0x8000>;
+			i-cache-line-size = <64>;
+			i-cache-sets = <128>;
 			next-level-cache = <&l2_0>;
 			power-domains = <&cpu_pd0>;
 			power-domain-names = "psci";
@@ -91,11 +97,17 @@ l2_0: l2-cache {
 				compatible = "cache";
 				cache-level = <2>;
 				cache-unified;
+				cache-size = <0x20000>;
+				cache-line-size = <64>;
+				cache-sets = <256>;
 				next-level-cache = <&l3_0>;
 				l3_0: l3-cache {
 					compatible = "cache";
 					cache-level = <3>;
 					cache-unified;
+					cache-size = <0x800000>;
+					cache-line-size = <64>;
+					cache-sets = <8192>;
 				};
 			};
 		};
